            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Paquetta Myrick-Hancock"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I loved this recipe! Having said that, however, I did make a few changes. I used seedless (English) cucumbers, substituted extra virgin olive oil for the vegetable oil, and added fresh mint. I did not think that 1/4 sugar was too much sugar. This is a delightful dish! Very fresh and satisfying and was a great accompaniment to my Easter dinner. Thank you so much for sharing this recipe!",
